[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ということがあったんだ。\nどうだ、麗しいきょうだい愛だろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So that's how it happened. Quite a beautiful display of sibling love, wouldn't you say?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今の回想は現状において必要でしたか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Was that really the time for reminiscing?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "リーベはもっと感情を持とう！\u3000な！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're too cold, Liebe! Come on, live a little!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "現状の議題は、このついて来た集落の少年を\nどう取り扱うかというものなのですが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The current issue at hand is what we should do about this boy from the settlement."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "外の人たち、強いんだろ？\n戦うとこ見せてくれよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You outsiders are strong, right? Let me see you fight!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少年",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Boy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何かしらの罠……というわけでもなく\n単純に興味本位なのは間違いないが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's not some kind of trap... He's clearly just curious, but still..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "魔物の巣にはほど近いですし、\n連れていくのは危険だと推測します",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're quite close to the monster den. I believe bringing him along would be dangerous."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだな、どうするか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're right. What should we do..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "少年を追い返す",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Send the boy away"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選択肢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やはり守るべき存在を危険にさらすわけにはいかん。\n少年、大人しく集落へ帰るといい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We can't put someone we should be protecting in danger. Boy, go back to your settlement quietly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "えー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aww..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少年",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Boy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アレだ……終わったら魔物の翼から抜けた羽根を\n特別にくれてやるから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tell you what... When we're done, I'll gift you a special feather from the monster's wing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほんと！？\u3000約束だよ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Really?! You promise?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少年",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Boy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "誘導が上手いですね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're quite good at persuasion."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "フッ、かわいいものだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heh, he's adorable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "少年を連れていく",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bring the boy along"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選択肢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ここまでついて来てしまったのなら仕方ない。\n私とリーベお姉さんのそばから離れないようにするんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Since you've already followed us this far, might as well go all the way. Just make sure you don't leave my side or Liebe's."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やった！\u3000分かったよ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Got it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "少年",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Boy"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "正気ですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you serious?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "自分の手や目の届く範囲に置いておくのが\n一番の安全策だと学んだんでな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've learned that keeping someone within arm's reach is the safest approach."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ゴゥ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gou"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁ……ゴゥ兄様の兄様ぶりが\nまた発揮されてしまいましたか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sigh... There goes his protective instincts again..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リーベ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Liebe"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]